1
00:00:34,959 --> 00:00:35,999
[This drama is fictional
and bears no resemblance to reality]

2
00:00:35,999 --> 00:00:37,009
[Some scenes feature AI technology]

3
00:00:37,009 --> 00:00:38,711
[All child and animal scenes
followed strict safety guidelines]

4
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,780
Yi Jae!

5
00:00:45,524 --> 00:00:47,291
Huh? What?

6
00:00:54,831 --> 00:00:56,849
You almost got hurt.

7
00:00:57,821 --> 00:00:59,840
Director Ju!

8
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,454
- Seong Moo?
- Are you okay?

9
00:01:02,454 --> 00:01:04,578
Who did this?

10
00:01:04,578 --> 00:01:08,134
Oh... I did! I'm so sorry! I'm really sorry!

11
00:01:08,134 --> 00:01:11,017
You punk! How many times
did I tell you not to run?

12
00:01:11,017 --> 00:01:12,944
I told you to be careful!

13
00:01:12,944 --> 00:01:14,506
Are you okay?

14
00:01:14,506 --> 00:01:17,268
Oh... you're bleeding!

15
00:01:17,268 --> 00:01:18,908
I'm okay.

16
00:01:18,908 --> 00:01:21,112
Yes, I'm okay.

17
00:01:21,112 --> 00:01:22,537
Oh...

18
00:01:22,537 --> 00:01:26,596
Maybe this means
today's shoot will go smoothly.

19
00:01:26,596 --> 00:01:28,776
Let's get you to the medic.

20
00:01:29,523 --> 00:01:30,673
Hurry.

21
00:01:30,673 --> 00:01:33,856
Get him to the medic! Clear the way!

22
00:01:35,554 --> 00:01:37,550
I told you to be careful.

23
00:01:39,102 --> 00:01:41,947
[Episode 9]

24
00:01:41,947 --> 00:01:45,253
Luckily, it's only a scratch.
It shouldn't affect filming.

25
00:01:45,253 --> 00:01:46,653
Thank you.

26
00:01:46,653 --> 00:01:48,781
Thank you.

27
00:01:50,133 --> 00:01:53,048
Your call time wasn't even close.
Why'd you come so early?

28
00:01:53,048 --> 00:01:54,691
And then you get hurt the moment you arrive.

29
00:01:54,691 --> 00:01:58,393
Maybe this is exactly why I came early.

30
00:01:58,393 --> 00:02:01,071
What would've happened if I hadn't been here?
Right?

31
00:02:01,071 --> 00:02:03,884
Actors should take care of themselves first.

32
00:02:05,694 --> 00:02:07,963
Director Ju...

33
00:02:07,963 --> 00:02:10,086
What did you think when you heard I was coming?

34
00:02:10,086 --> 00:02:14,840
I was surprised.
I thought you'd never want to see me again.

35
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,389
Why would I?

36
00:02:16,389 --> 00:02:17,880
Because I...

37
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:21,132
wasn't exactly a good girlfriend to you.

38
00:02:26,068 --> 00:02:29,925
- Oh, you.
- What...

39
00:02:29,925 --> 00:02:31,845
Darn it.

40
00:02:37,592 --> 00:02:40,358
Director! Director! We're all set.

41
00:02:40,358 --> 00:02:43,489
- Yeah, I'll be right there.
- Yeah.

42
00:02:43,489 --> 00:02:47,700
Yeah... yeah? We're all set...

43
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:50,080
Oh... yeah.

44
00:02:51,618 --> 00:02:53,867
Director Ju! Director Ju!

45
00:02:53,867 --> 00:02:57,415
Why are you rushing me? I'm coming.

46
00:02:58,887 --> 00:03:01,063
Sorry for the late greeting, Director Woo.

47
00:03:01,063 --> 00:03:02,698
You look perfectly fine.

48
00:03:02,698 --> 00:03:06,036
So let's just save the greetings.
We need to shoot.

49
00:03:06,036 --> 00:03:07,124
Let's go, Yi Jae.

50
00:03:07,124 --> 00:03:09,269
Bye, oppa! See you later!

51
00:03:11,573 --> 00:03:13,847
"Oppa?"

52
00:03:13,847 --> 00:03:16,085
So the guy everyone was making a fuss about
was Geum Seong Moo?

53
00:03:16,085 --> 00:03:18,757
- How'd you know?
- How could I not?

54
00:03:18,757 --> 00:03:22,499
Oh, I really was going to tell you
before he got here.

55
00:03:22,499 --> 00:03:24,184
Quit calling him "oppa."

56
00:03:24,184 --> 00:03:25,858
What were you gonna say?

57
00:03:25,858 --> 00:03:27,933
That the guy you thought was dead
suddenly came back to life?

58
00:03:27,933 --> 00:03:32,315
Well... that's just how it is.
After a breakup, you act like your ex is dead.

59
00:03:32,315 --> 00:03:35,912
It's only respectful to the person
you're with now. Right?

60
00:03:37,557 --> 00:03:39,743
Oh, you.

61
00:03:40,350 --> 00:03:42,081
What was that?

62
00:03:42,081 --> 00:03:45,241
- What?
- "Oh, you." What was that?

63
00:03:45,241 --> 00:03:47,519
- Maybe you were just too cute.
- What was that?

64
00:03:47,519 --> 00:03:50,252
"What was that?" Jeez...

65
00:03:51,859 --> 00:03:55,042
Hey, stop right there!

66
00:04:19,478 --> 00:04:21,079
I'll kill you.

67
00:04:27,852 --> 00:04:29,407
<i>Cut!</i>

68
00:04:30,097 --> 00:04:31,966
Okay!

69
00:04:31,966 --> 00:04:33,577
Okay.

70
00:04:33,577 --> 00:04:35,916
Okay.

71
00:04:35,916 --> 00:04:37,510
Are you okay?

72
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,134
- Moo Gyeom.
- Yes.

73
00:04:39,134 --> 00:04:41,029
- Good. We got it.
- Thank you.

74
00:04:41,029 --> 00:04:42,996
You've gotten so much better.

75
00:04:42,996 --> 00:04:44,280
Director Woo!

76
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:47,019
One more take and
my shoulder would've given out.

77
00:04:47,019 --> 00:04:51,109
Thank you, DP.
It turned out great, thanks to you.

78
00:05:05,447 --> 00:05:08,218
- Wow, Sim Yu Geon!
- Seong Moo!

79
00:05:08,218 --> 00:05:10,681
You're finally starting to
look like a real actor.

80
00:05:11,715 --> 00:05:14,949
- It's been forever!
- How have you been?

81
00:05:15,863 --> 00:05:18,288
Oh, it's so good to see you. Thanks, really.

82
00:05:18,288 --> 00:05:20,435
Jeez...

83
00:05:22,113 --> 00:05:24,507
They're really that close?

84
00:05:24,507 --> 00:05:26,367
They look happy to see each other. Why?

85
00:05:26,367 --> 00:05:31,254
Everyone! Lunch is on Commander Crow today!

86
00:05:31,254 --> 00:05:34,096
Please head over to the food truck!

87
00:05:38,064 --> 00:05:39,590
- Crow! Crow!
- My pleasure.

88
00:05:39,590 --> 00:05:41,324
Unbelievable... Jeez.

89
00:05:41,324 --> 00:05:42,702
That's our Seong Moo.

90
00:05:42,702 --> 00:05:45,423
It's Director Ju's first set.

91
00:05:46,143 --> 00:05:49,311
- "That's our Seong Moo?" Oh...
- This is the least I could do. Learn that.

92
00:05:49,311 --> 00:05:51,006
- What? Are you jealous?
- This is the bare minimum.

93
00:05:51,006 --> 00:05:54,326
- Jealous? Me? Of those two?
- No, that's not it. It's not like that.

94
00:05:54,326 --> 00:05:55,650
- No, I don't care.
- Actor Sim!

95
00:05:55,650 --> 00:05:57,764
Actor Geum!

96
00:05:59,786 --> 00:06:02,145
It's been so long.

97
00:06:06,116 --> 00:06:07,733
Seong Moo...

98
00:06:07,733 --> 00:06:08,948
[Go, Gyeongseong Love Song!]

99
00:06:08,948 --> 00:06:10,548
[Congratulations on your directorial debut,
Director Ju Yi Jae]

100
00:06:10,548 --> 00:06:15,861
Touched? I made it big.
This is the least I could do.

101
00:06:15,861 --> 00:06:17,678
Why did you have to make it big?

102
00:06:17,678 --> 00:06:19,585
What's with all this? This is so embarrassing.

103
00:06:19,585 --> 00:06:21,711
How can you take three rolls all for yourself?

104
00:06:21,711 --> 00:06:24,451
Thanks to Director Ju, we're eating well today.

105
00:06:24,451 --> 00:06:26,514
You've got some amazing connections.
Thanks for the food!

106
00:06:26,514 --> 00:06:30,172
Now that's what I call connections.
Right, Ms. Namgung Se Ra?

107
00:06:30,172 --> 00:06:32,802
You're right... Mr. Paleolithic Age.

108
00:06:32,802 --> 00:06:36,035
Wow, we actually have great banter.
Come with me!

109
00:06:36,035 --> 00:06:39,316
You really are lucky with people, Director Ju.

110
00:06:39,316 --> 00:06:41,809
You have your high school classmate
Director Woo

111
00:06:41,809 --> 00:06:44,569
and your college friend Actor Geum.

112
00:06:44,569 --> 00:06:46,669
Wow...

113
00:06:48,563 --> 00:06:50,469
Was he taking a jab at me?

114
00:06:50,469 --> 00:06:53,894
That's just how he is. Anyway, let's eat.

115
00:06:53,894 --> 00:06:56,527
Before that, let's get a picture first.

116
00:06:56,527 --> 00:06:59,252
A photo? That's okay.

117
00:06:59,252 --> 00:07:02,270
- All right...
- No, it's fine. No...

118
00:07:03,655 --> 00:07:07,356
Congratulations! Cute pose, cute pose!

119
00:07:07,356 --> 00:07:09,219
Come on, stop.

120
00:07:09,219 --> 00:07:10,678
Yeah, just like that.

121
00:07:10,678 --> 00:07:14,674
No, we agreed your cameo stays a secret
until the movie comes out.

122
00:07:14,674 --> 00:07:19,108
I know. I'll post them
when it's time to promote it.

123
00:07:19,108 --> 00:07:20,861
Don't worry.

124
00:07:23,626 --> 00:07:25,602
That's Yi Jae's least favorite angle.

125
00:07:25,602 --> 00:07:28,601
He is terrible at taking selfies. Jeez...

126
00:07:28,601 --> 00:07:33,479
I told you. One of her exes
is a big-name actor.

127
00:07:33,479 --> 00:07:35,170
When did you tell me that?

128
00:07:35,170 --> 00:07:37,324
You just weren't listening.

129
00:07:38,179 --> 00:07:39,405
[From your No. 1 fan, Geum Seong Moo]
"No. 1 fan?"

130
00:07:39,405 --> 00:07:40,476
I'm her number one fan!

131
00:07:40,476 --> 00:07:44,309
Even Seong Moo doesn't get to say that.

132
00:07:44,309 --> 00:07:46,267
Right? Jeez...

133
00:07:46,267 --> 00:07:49,765
I've been her number one fan
since middle school!

134
00:07:49,765 --> 00:07:51,243
Forget it.

135
00:07:51,243 --> 00:07:54,175
Then why are you so close to Geum Seong Moo?

136
00:07:54,175 --> 00:07:56,207
The three of us used to hang out all the time.

137
00:07:56,207 --> 00:08:00,155
The three of us used to hang out too.
So why do you like him?

138
00:08:00,155 --> 00:08:01,993
You said if Yi Jae hated someone,
you'd hate them too.

139
00:08:01,993 --> 00:08:05,749
Isn't that why you've always
had an attitude with me?

140
00:08:05,749 --> 00:08:08,247
Because she'd never hate Seong Moo.

141
00:08:08,247 --> 00:08:10,016
What? Why?

142
00:08:10,016 --> 00:08:14,406
Because he was good to her until the very end.

143
00:08:15,748 --> 00:08:17,463
Unlike someone else...

144
00:08:17,463 --> 00:08:18,815
Hey, Yu Geon!

145
00:08:18,815 --> 00:08:20,090
Yeah?

146
00:08:20,803 --> 00:08:22,980
Please take a picture of Yi Jae and me.

147
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:26,462
- Make sure you get the banner too.
- That punk is no different.

148
00:08:26,462 --> 00:08:29,462
- Heart!
- All right, nice and natural.

149
00:08:29,462 --> 00:08:31,039
Stand a little closer.

150
00:08:31,039 --> 00:08:35,780
<i>- Director Ju, like this.
- One, Two...</i>

151
00:08:39,019 --> 00:08:41,047
Director!

152
00:08:41,047 --> 00:08:42,517
What?

153
00:08:42,517 --> 00:08:43,970
- Oh.
- Director Woo?

154
00:08:43,970 --> 00:08:46,238
- The line starts over there.
- Oh, right. Go ahead.

155
00:08:46,238 --> 00:08:47,446
- Yeah.
- Go ahead. Take it.

156
00:08:47,446 --> 00:08:49,583
All right, again.

157
00:08:49,583 --> 00:08:52,391
<i>- One, two...
- But...</i>

158
00:08:52,391 --> 00:08:54,560
I do have one complaint.

159
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:58,232
Your profile picture's a little... cheesy.

160
00:08:59,413 --> 00:09:02,494
How about taking a new profile picture?

161
00:09:03,354 --> 00:09:06,084
- What are you doing, Director Woo?
- What?

162
00:09:06,822 --> 00:09:09,761
<i>See? Doesn't it feel a little different?</i>

163
00:09:09,761 --> 00:09:11,160
<i>See?</i>

164
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:13,009
Wow...

165
00:09:13,009 --> 00:09:17,771
It's been a while since the three of us
had snack food together. Right?

166
00:09:17,771 --> 00:09:18,882
You're right.

167
00:09:18,882 --> 00:09:21,876
When we helped her with filming,
our late-night snack was always gimbap.

168
00:09:21,876 --> 00:09:26,863
- Even though Seong Moo didn't even like it...
- You didn't? You never told me that.

169
00:09:27,726 --> 00:09:30,328
How could he tell you he didn't like it
when you always brought him gimbap?

170
00:09:30,328 --> 00:09:31,946
Oh!

171
00:09:31,946 --> 00:09:33,186
But, that place closed down.

172
00:09:33,186 --> 00:09:34,193
- Really?
- Why?

173
00:09:34,193 --> 00:09:37,483
- It was so good.
- I know.

174
00:09:37,483 --> 00:09:40,618
The twist donuts shop
we used to go to is still there.

175
00:09:40,618 --> 00:09:41,713
- Right? Yeah.
- Yeah.

176
00:09:41,713 --> 00:09:43,566
Oh!

177
00:09:43,566 --> 00:09:46,929
The one in that market alley...
that place is good.

178
00:09:50,297 --> 00:09:53,946
Wow... he only went there once,
and he still remembers it.

179
00:09:54,579 --> 00:09:57,136
One visit was all it took.

180
00:09:57,136 --> 00:09:59,002
That punk...

181
00:10:00,725 --> 00:10:01,867
What should we do?

182
00:10:01,867 --> 00:10:06,070
Looks like we're one chair short.

183
00:10:07,362 --> 00:10:09,971
Then Director Woo and I will eat outside.

184
00:10:09,971 --> 00:10:11,344
Why?

185
00:10:11,344 --> 00:10:13,248
Let's all eat together.

186
00:10:14,234 --> 00:10:16,823
We still haven't properly introduced ourselves.

187
00:10:17,867 --> 00:10:20,054
Mind if I borrow a chair?

188
00:10:20,054 --> 00:10:22,462
- Yes.
- Thank you.

189
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,152
Sit down, Yi Jae.

190
00:10:49,355 --> 00:10:52,266
Director Ju, you can eat carrots now?

191
00:10:52,266 --> 00:10:53,786
Look at you, all grown up.

192
00:10:53,786 --> 00:10:55,791
Guess he doesn't know
the story behind the carrots.

193
00:10:55,791 --> 00:10:58,364
He wouldn't be smiling if you did.

194
00:10:59,104 --> 00:11:02,165
I'm over 30 now.
I can't be a picky eater anymore.

195
00:11:02,165 --> 00:11:06,448
Chew slowly, Director Ju.
You might get indigestion.

196
00:11:06,448 --> 00:11:07,674
Seong Moo!

197
00:11:07,674 --> 00:11:10,128
Hearing you call her "Director Ju"
gives me goosebumps.

198
00:11:10,128 --> 00:11:12,890
Why? She is Director Ju.
Would you rather he call her "Yi Jae?"

199
00:11:12,890 --> 00:11:14,827
It used to be my nickname for her.

200
00:11:26,084 --> 00:11:30,533
Wait... so my nickname for you
became your actual title?

201
00:11:30,533 --> 00:11:35,449
Then are you going to call me
"Actor Geum" again, like you used to?

202
00:11:35,449 --> 00:11:38,642
Well, since you're not Actor Kim,
I should call you Actor Geum.

203
00:11:38,642 --> 00:11:41,900
- I'm finished. Mind if I head out first?
- Director Ju.

204
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:44,397
You changed your number, right?
Let me have your new one.

205
00:11:44,397 --> 00:11:48,343
You're only here for three scenes.
You don't need her number.

206
00:11:48,343 --> 00:11:49,984
Just call me instead. 010...

207
00:11:49,984 --> 00:11:53,232
When I called her "Director Ju" just now,
that was my nickname for her.

208
00:11:53,232 --> 00:11:55,568
I'm asking on a personal level.

209
00:12:00,678 --> 00:12:04,780
It's just a phone number.
No big deal. I'll give it to you.

210
00:12:08,771 --> 00:12:10,263
Here.

211
00:12:11,975 --> 00:12:14,072
[Geum Seong Moo Oppa]

212
00:12:14,072 --> 00:12:16,267
Huh? You already had my number.

213
00:12:16,267 --> 00:12:18,274
Why do I still have it? This...

214
00:12:18,274 --> 00:12:19,354
Oh! Well...

215
00:12:19,354 --> 00:12:22,596
Maybe it got synced over
when I changed phones. Right?

216
00:12:22,596 --> 00:12:24,978
Oh... I guess so.

217
00:12:26,964 --> 00:12:29,210
Thanks for the meal.

218
00:12:30,387 --> 00:12:32,695
Hey, wait up!

219
00:12:34,408 --> 00:12:35,930
Then I'll get going too.

220
00:12:42,011 --> 00:12:44,656
I'll put the chair back.

221
00:12:50,617 --> 00:12:52,557
That guy, I swear...

222
00:12:57,503 --> 00:13:00,221
- Are you okay?
- Director, we're ready.

223
00:13:00,221 --> 00:13:02,852
Oh... are you sure you can do this?
It looks dangerous...

224
00:13:02,852 --> 00:13:05,093
I'm basically Takeshi Kaneshiro.

225
00:13:06,168 --> 00:13:07,714
Okay.

226
00:13:07,714 --> 00:13:10,915
Well... I'd like Crow's jump
to feel less like a leap

227
00:13:10,915 --> 00:13:12,994
and more like he's taking flight.
Like a real crow.

228
00:13:12,994 --> 00:13:16,883
Bigger, bigger. Like this.

229
00:13:17,582 --> 00:13:18,507
"Bigger..."

230
00:13:18,507 --> 00:13:20,254
- That's what I told the stunt coordinator too.
- "Bigger..."

231
00:13:20,254 --> 00:13:23,959
No... it only looks silly because I do it.

232
00:13:23,959 --> 00:13:26,281
Anyway, you get what I mean, right?

233
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:30,421
Sound Mixer, is the actors' audio feed off?

234
00:13:30,421 --> 00:13:31,588
I can't hear them.

235
00:13:31,588 --> 00:13:35,303
- Yeah, we muted it for the drone rehearsal.
- No, turn it back on!

236
00:13:36,085 --> 00:13:38,673
Wireless sound check...
yeah, we should do that.

237
00:13:38,673 --> 00:13:42,421
Now? It sounds fine to me...

238
00:13:43,336 --> 00:13:45,274
Uh... sure.

239
00:13:45,274 --> 00:13:46,512
Yeah, it's on.

240
00:13:46,512 --> 00:13:48,274
<i>Yi Jae...</i>

241
00:13:48,274 --> 00:13:51,353
- you don't mind me being here, do you?
- What?

242
00:13:52,167 --> 00:13:54,166
What are you talking about?

243
00:13:54,166 --> 00:13:57,411
You're the star who's shaking up
the entire country right now.

244
00:13:57,411 --> 00:13:59,938
Can't you see how grateful I am?

245
00:13:59,938 --> 00:14:03,251
But why do you keep speaking so formally?

246
00:14:03,251 --> 00:14:06,956
- Am I making you uncomfortable?
- Me?

247
00:14:06,956 --> 00:14:09,137
See? You're still speaking formally.

248
00:14:11,096 --> 00:14:12,494
Am I the only one...

249
00:14:12,494 --> 00:14:15,090
who's happy to see you again?

250
00:14:15,090 --> 00:14:18,453
<i>I'm happy too. Seeing someone like you...</i>

251
00:14:18,453 --> 00:14:20,243
Did she say she's happy?

252
00:14:20,243 --> 00:14:22,167
I mean... that's what she said, right?

253
00:14:22,167 --> 00:14:25,332
Yeah, I definitely heard that part, but...

254
00:14:25,332 --> 00:14:26,420
<i>Honestly...</i>

255
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,768
it was a relief too.

256
00:14:28,768 --> 00:14:30,638
I felt like I didn't have to
feel so guilty anymore.

257
00:14:30,638 --> 00:14:31,997
They're speaking casually?

258
00:14:31,997 --> 00:14:33,912
<i>You have nothing to feel guilty about.</i>

259
00:14:33,912 --> 00:14:35,872
<i>Yi Jae, I...</i>

260
00:14:35,872 --> 00:14:38,660
<i>I liked every moment I spent with you.</i>

261
00:14:43,484 --> 00:14:46,633
The girl who dreamed of
becoming a director became a director,

262
00:14:46,633 --> 00:14:50,128
and the aspiring actor became an actor.
And now we're meeting again like this.

263
00:14:50,128 --> 00:14:51,215
Come on.

264
00:14:51,215 --> 00:14:53,970
I've still got a long way to go
compared to you.

265
00:14:53,970 --> 00:14:56,007
You're amazing, Actor Geum.

266
00:14:57,695 --> 00:15:00,020
Sometimes, I miss it...

267
00:15:00,020 --> 00:15:04,270
The way you used to call me "Actor Geum."

268
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,541
Huh?

269
00:15:23,290 --> 00:15:24,979
Yi Jae...

270
00:15:34,159 --> 00:15:35,793
<i>What if we...</i>

271
00:15:35,793 --> 00:15:40,103
- "What if we..." What?
- Man, the wind's brutal today.

272
00:15:40,103 --> 00:15:42,435
[Director Ju Yi Jae, Director Woo Soo Bin]

273
00:15:43,830 --> 00:15:46,039
Get apart, you two!

274
00:15:47,542 --> 00:15:50,879
Director, which rifle should the Crow use?

275
00:15:54,830 --> 00:15:56,865
This is nice.

276
00:15:56,865 --> 00:16:00,065
Wow! Director Woo...

277
00:16:00,712 --> 00:16:02,416
you're full of hidden talents.

278
00:16:02,416 --> 00:16:06,635
- I don't like it.
- Then... how about this one?

279
00:16:06,635 --> 00:16:08,379
Let's use this one.

280
00:16:12,681 --> 00:16:15,882
Don't rub it. I'll blow it out.

281
00:16:15,882 --> 00:16:17,833
Wait.

282
00:16:17,833 --> 00:16:20,553
Seong Moo, I think I am uncomfortable.

283
00:16:20,553 --> 00:16:23,150
While we're on set, let's just...

284
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:26,005
keep things strictly director and actor.

285
00:16:29,064 --> 00:16:31,010
Okay!

286
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:33,069
On set, then.

287
00:16:34,861 --> 00:16:37,330
Shall we go, Director Ju?

288
00:16:37,330 --> 00:16:42,184
- We're ready. Rehearsing Crow's scene.
<i>- Yes.</i>

289
00:16:42,184 --> 00:16:43,830
Crow,

290
00:16:43,830 --> 00:16:46,547
can we talk for a minute after rehearsal?

291
00:17:06,986 --> 00:17:09,550
If I'd known you and Yi Jae used to date,

292
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:11,590
I would've turned down your offer to appear.

293
00:17:11,590 --> 00:17:14,180
Especially, if I'd known
you were still hung up on her.

294
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:16,534
"Hung up on her?"

295
00:17:18,349 --> 00:17:20,756
I wonder if Yi Jae knows.

296
00:17:20,756 --> 00:17:22,675
I hope she does.

297
00:17:25,373 --> 00:17:27,813
That's enough.

298
00:17:27,813 --> 00:17:30,754
This is Yi Jae's workplace.

299
00:17:30,754 --> 00:17:33,180
The crew thinks you two are...

300
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:36,553
just old high school friends.

301
00:17:36,553 --> 00:17:38,676
Guess you don't feel the need
to hide it from me.

302
00:17:38,676 --> 00:17:42,671
You already know what there is
between Yi Jae and me.

303
00:17:43,987 --> 00:17:47,865
I heard you two were
each other's first loves...

304
00:17:47,865 --> 00:17:50,022
I just knew you two were that close.

305
00:17:50,022 --> 00:17:53,435
In fact, the reason I started dating Yi Jae...

306
00:17:54,327 --> 00:17:56,741
is because of you, Director Woo.

307
00:17:57,540 --> 00:18:00,692
Well, whenever she'd had a few drinks,

308
00:18:00,692 --> 00:18:02,719
what did she say? Oh.

309
00:18:02,719 --> 00:18:04,531
That she broke up...

310
00:18:04,531 --> 00:18:07,032
with her first love
before she even got to kiss her.

311
00:18:07,032 --> 00:18:08,950
So I gave her that kiss instead.

312
00:18:08,950 --> 00:18:11,243
I made sure her first kiss...

313
00:18:12,505 --> 00:18:14,947
helped her forget her first love.

314
00:18:23,945 --> 00:18:25,730
Guess it really wasn't that big a deal.

315
00:18:25,730 --> 00:18:29,982
I heard you were just an acting student
who helped on her shoots.

316
00:18:29,982 --> 00:18:32,364
Well, it's just three scenes,

317
00:18:32,364 --> 00:18:35,293
but I look forward to working with you,

318
00:18:35,293 --> 00:18:36,886
Actor Geum.

319
00:18:47,582 --> 00:18:49,200
Everyone!

320
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:53,739
- Please have some gimbap.
- Thank you.

321
00:18:53,739 --> 00:18:57,511
Actor Geum treated the whole crew
to lunch today.

322
00:18:57,511 --> 00:18:59,857
What? Geum Seong Moo?

323
00:18:59,857 --> 00:19:02,174
This is exactly why I can't stand him.

324
00:19:02,174 --> 00:19:06,253
If the cameo steals the spotlight,
what's left for the lead actress?

325
00:19:06,253 --> 00:19:07,918
I was planning to bring in a food truck myself.

326
00:19:07,918 --> 00:19:09,798
Oh, I know, I know.

327
00:19:09,798 --> 00:19:12,583
That's why I've already laid the groundwork.

328
00:19:12,583 --> 00:19:14,231
I told everyone
you've got something planned too.

329
00:19:14,231 --> 00:19:17,852
I already told the staff you'd be
treating them to a big meal

330
00:19:17,852 --> 00:19:21,658
whenever they're out shooting
in the cold and get hungry.

331
00:19:21,658 --> 00:19:24,925
- You're always one step ahead.
- Of course.

332
00:19:24,925 --> 00:19:28,849
Well, I may not be great at
driving and stuff...

333
00:19:28,849 --> 00:19:32,094
but that's exactly why I've been
your manager all this time.

334
00:19:32,094 --> 00:19:34,368
I know.

335
00:19:35,553 --> 00:19:38,471
It's really good!

336
00:19:38,471 --> 00:19:40,468
You should try some. Ah!

337
00:19:40,468 --> 00:19:42,318
I've got a kissing scene to shoot.

338
00:19:42,318 --> 00:19:43,673
I'll eat afterward.

339
00:19:43,673 --> 00:19:46,003
Since when do you care about things like that?

340
00:19:46,003 --> 00:19:48,281
Just eat and brush your teeth.

341
00:19:48,281 --> 00:19:49,887
No, thanks.

342
00:19:49,887 --> 00:19:52,020
I don't think I can get the gimbap down.

343
00:19:57,354 --> 00:19:59,328
Sim Yu Geon!

344
00:19:59,328 --> 00:20:01,033
Come here.

345
00:20:02,956 --> 00:20:05,347
Do we really have to do this?

346
00:20:05,347 --> 00:20:08,310
Just deal with it.
I'm not exactly thrilled either.

347
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:10,124
It's your first kissing scene.

348
00:20:10,124 --> 00:20:13,752
A kissing scene is choreographed
just like an action scene.

349
00:20:13,752 --> 00:20:15,162
Stay focused, okay?

350
00:20:15,162 --> 00:20:17,668
- I'll go watch from over there.
- Yeah.

351
00:20:20,502 --> 00:20:23,524
"The distance between them slowly closes...

352
00:20:23,524 --> 00:20:25,400
Their eyes lock.

353
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:30,910
Nan Young removes Moo Gyeom's glasses
and looks into his eyes."

354
00:20:31,930 --> 00:20:33,962
Nan Young's line.

355
00:20:33,962 --> 00:20:36,768
I thought these glasses alone
had clouded my vision...

356
00:20:36,768 --> 00:20:41,267
but it was my love for you
that truly blinded me.

357
00:20:43,899 --> 00:20:45,657
I love you.

358
00:20:47,171 --> 00:20:48,873
Moo Gyeom, focus.

359
00:20:48,873 --> 00:20:53,134
"Moved by her confession,
Moo Gyeom slowly kisses her."

360
00:20:54,834 --> 00:20:56,786
Slowly.

361
00:21:10,088 --> 00:21:13,610
Better with both hands on the face?
What do you think?

362
00:21:13,610 --> 00:21:15,067
- Get a little lower.
- Like this?

363
00:21:15,067 --> 00:21:16,967
- Yes.
- Okay.

364
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:21,500
Moo Gyeom, keep your eyes on Nan Young.

365
00:21:24,961 --> 00:21:27,182
This feels much more emotional.

366
00:21:27,182 --> 00:21:29,176
Moo Gyeom, try it again.

367
00:21:32,805 --> 00:21:34,772
Kiss...

368
00:21:36,912 --> 00:21:39,660
What if Nan Young kisses him first?

369
00:21:42,870 --> 00:21:47,389
She's confessing her love to her enemy.

370
00:21:47,389 --> 00:21:51,903
This is probably the first time
she's truly taking control of her own life.

371
00:21:51,903 --> 00:21:57,352
Wouldn't this be the spark
that eventually leads her to escape Wolhajeong?

372
00:21:57,352 --> 00:21:59,959
You mean you wanted this kiss
to be the first choice

373
00:21:59,959 --> 00:22:02,891
Nan Young made entirely for herself?

374
00:22:05,313 --> 00:22:08,052
I think we overlooked that.

375
00:22:08,052 --> 00:22:10,995
Then why don't we do what Nan Young said?

376
00:22:10,995 --> 00:22:12,458
I love it.

377
00:22:13,806 --> 00:22:15,558
Thank you.

378
00:22:15,558 --> 00:22:17,220
Shall we try?

379
00:22:17,220 --> 00:22:19,652
- We'll go down and check.
- Yeah.

380
00:22:20,979 --> 00:22:24,771
"The distance between them slowly closes...

381
00:22:24,771 --> 00:22:27,267
Their eyes lock...

382
00:22:27,267 --> 00:22:31,945
Nan Young removes Moo Gyeom's glasses
and looks into his eyes."

383
00:22:33,604 --> 00:22:38,533
I thought these glasses alone
had clouded my vision...

384
00:22:38,533 --> 00:22:44,533
but it was my love for you
that truly blinded me.

385
00:22:50,470 --> 00:22:52,405
I love you.

386
00:22:54,374 --> 00:22:55,813
That's so much better, right?

387
00:22:55,813 --> 00:22:58,339
Nan Young's emotions come through
much more clearly.

388
00:23:01,394 --> 00:23:03,247
Should I...

389
00:23:04,366 --> 00:23:06,470
tilt my head this way?

390
00:23:08,299 --> 00:23:10,275
You're really making me mad.

391
00:23:11,013 --> 00:23:13,375
You don't even remember that day, right?

392
00:23:30,973 --> 00:23:33,174
Should I do it like this?

393
00:23:33,174 --> 00:23:36,147
Yes, I think it's great.

394
00:23:36,147 --> 00:23:39,488
Maybe dial it back just a little...

395
00:23:40,115 --> 00:23:43,921
- I'll touch up my lipstick and be right back.
- Yes.

396
00:23:57,337 --> 00:23:59,524
Beautiful. Just beautiful.

397
00:23:59,524 --> 00:24:02,584
I can't believe there's a kiss scene
we can finish in just one take...

398
00:24:02,584 --> 00:24:05,329
All that intense rehearsal paid off.

399
00:24:07,864 --> 00:24:10,927
So we only have two days left filming
at the Wolhajeong set, right?

400
00:24:10,927 --> 00:24:12,942
I've gotten attached to it.

401
00:24:12,942 --> 00:24:16,718
It's a little bittersweet
knowing we're almost done.

402
00:24:19,897 --> 00:24:25,238
Well, Directors, mind if I make a suggestion?

403
00:24:25,238 --> 00:24:27,716
Oh, sure. Is something wrong?

404
00:24:27,716 --> 00:24:30,941
Everyone's probably getting worn out by now.

405
00:24:30,941 --> 00:24:32,836
We should do something to recharge.

406
00:24:32,836 --> 00:24:34,843
He's right, Director.

407
00:24:34,843 --> 00:24:36,424
Let's have a team outing.

408
00:24:36,424 --> 00:24:39,276
We never got everyone together
during pre-production.

409
00:24:39,276 --> 00:24:43,952
True. They usually have a team outing
before filming starts.

410
00:24:43,952 --> 00:24:45,201
But...

411
00:24:45,201 --> 00:24:48,347
don't you think the crew will mind?

412
00:24:48,347 --> 00:24:49,833
- Come on.
- Come on.

413
00:24:49,833 --> 00:24:53,242
Throw in some good prizes,
and everyone will be fighting to come.

414
00:24:53,242 --> 00:24:54,708
- That's right.
- Right.

415
00:24:54,708 --> 00:24:58,281
- I'm going for the fridge.
- You really want the fridge that badly?

416
00:24:58,281 --> 00:25:00,374
Planning a team outing?

417
00:25:01,852 --> 00:25:03,596
Seong Moo! You're still here?

418
00:25:03,596 --> 00:25:08,562
Hey! Comrade Moo Gyeom. Did filming go well?

419
00:25:11,561 --> 00:25:15,828
- What is it with you two?
- Oh? Ha Na!

420
00:25:15,828 --> 00:25:17,727
It's been a while.

421
00:25:17,727 --> 00:25:21,016
- When did you get here?
- I'm the lead actress here!

422
00:25:21,016 --> 00:25:24,662
Oh, right, right. I forgot.

423
00:25:24,662 --> 00:25:28,758
If you're really going,
I can book the glamping site I always use.

424
00:25:28,758 --> 00:25:29,844
Why don't we go there?

425
00:25:29,844 --> 00:25:32,947
- Wow.
- Nice!

426
00:25:32,947 --> 00:25:38,075
- You too?
- You think I'd just book it and not come?

427
00:25:38,075 --> 00:25:41,181
The cameo buys lunch
and now wants to tag along on the retreat too?

428
00:25:41,181 --> 00:25:43,735
Learn when to step in and when to step back.

429
00:25:43,735 --> 00:25:47,193
Are you discriminating against cameos?

430
00:25:47,193 --> 00:25:50,516
To me, you're already like family.

431
00:25:50,516 --> 00:25:54,506
- Fighting, Gyeongseong Love Song!
- Fighting!

432
00:25:54,506 --> 00:25:57,263
I guess he always has to be
the center of attention.

433
00:25:57,263 --> 00:25:59,448
I seriously can't stand him.

434
00:26:00,244 --> 00:26:01,867
Looks like we finally agree on
something for once.

435
00:26:01,867 --> 00:26:04,226
Except for you two...

436
00:26:04,226 --> 00:26:06,631
it seems like everyone here wants me.

437
00:26:06,631 --> 00:26:08,750
- Right, Director Ju?
- Pardon?

438
00:26:08,750 --> 00:26:12,379
- I can come, can't I?
- Oh, well...

439
00:26:20,032 --> 00:26:24,338
Well, of course... we'd love to have you.

440
00:26:25,463 --> 00:26:29,025
- Yeah, let's go together.
- That'll be fun.

441
00:26:37,887 --> 00:26:39,903
[Geum Seong Moo Oppa, New Messages]
["Geum Seong Moo Oppa" has sent a photo]

442
00:26:41,841 --> 00:26:44,264
["Geum Seong Moo Oppa" has sent a photo]

443
00:26:46,953 --> 00:26:48,745
[Ju Yi Jae, Not added to favorites]
How did my phone...

444
00:26:48,745 --> 00:26:51,263
[Woo Soo Bin, Connecting]
even connect?

445
00:26:51,263 --> 00:26:52,622
Hand it over.

446
00:26:52,622 --> 00:26:53,981
Hey!

447
00:26:53,981 --> 00:26:55,862
Let's respect each other's privacy.

448
00:26:55,862 --> 00:26:57,055
Privacy?

449
00:26:57,055 --> 00:27:00,095
Since when did Geum Seong Moo
become your private life?

450
00:27:02,355 --> 00:27:05,613
Oh! They're just the photos
we took at the snack truck today.

451
00:27:05,613 --> 00:27:07,550
See? Look!

452
00:27:07,550 --> 00:27:10,576
You saw it, right? Eyes on the road.

453
00:27:10,576 --> 00:27:13,147
It's fine, well...

454
00:27:13,147 --> 00:27:14,595
Oh, "It's fine?"

455
00:27:14,595 --> 00:27:17,879
Oh? Woo Soo Bin, are you a cool guy now?

456
00:27:17,879 --> 00:27:20,352
I'm not cool.

457
00:27:20,352 --> 00:27:21,856
I realized...

458
00:27:21,856 --> 00:27:26,789
someone could actually die from jealousy.

459
00:27:26,789 --> 00:27:31,277
Why? What are you jealous of?
You're the one I like.

460
00:27:31,277 --> 00:27:32,607
I mean...

461
00:27:32,607 --> 00:27:37,440
he knows a version of you I've never met.

462
00:27:38,388 --> 00:27:41,345
And I bet you were adorable back then.

463
00:27:41,345 --> 00:27:44,085
Well, I'd be a little jealous too
if I were you.

464
00:27:44,085 --> 00:27:46,616
But don't worry. I'm even prettier now
than I was in my twenties.

465
00:27:46,616 --> 00:27:49,229
Then I'm even more worried about now.

466
00:27:50,379 --> 00:27:53,610
Back there on the bridge...

467
00:27:54,713 --> 00:27:57,707
Never mind. I don't want to know.

468
00:27:57,707 --> 00:28:00,341
It's already bothering me enough.

469
00:28:02,763 --> 00:28:04,381
Ju Yi Jae.

470
00:28:05,411 --> 00:28:10,003
Even if he was good to you,
I still don't like him.

471
00:28:10,003 --> 00:28:11,644
So...

472
00:28:11,644 --> 00:28:16,480
if I end up acting pathetic sometimes,

473
00:28:17,874 --> 00:28:20,114
just bear with me.

474
00:28:25,856 --> 00:28:28,895
Don't you think I'm a little better-looking?

475
00:28:28,895 --> 00:28:34,703
- Is Geum Seong Moo... handsome?
- No!

476
00:28:35,993 --> 00:28:38,267
- Alright.
- You're handsome.

477
00:28:38,267 --> 00:28:39,352
- Me?
- Yeah.

478
00:28:39,352 --> 00:28:41,802
[Love Chain, Character Relationship Map]

479
00:28:41,802 --> 00:28:43,356
- Have you eaten?
- Yeah.

480
00:28:43,356 --> 00:28:45,056
- Go grab something to eat.
- Yeah.

481
00:28:45,056 --> 00:28:48,620
Hey, go grab something to eat too.

482
00:28:48,620 --> 00:28:52,657
- What's wrong?
- It's just so sad...

483
00:28:52,657 --> 00:28:54,610
Look at Hyo Rim.

484
00:28:54,610 --> 00:28:57,363
The new guy just turned her down.

485
00:28:57,363 --> 00:29:00,439
He said he likes someone else.

486
00:29:03,436 --> 00:29:06,306
<i>He said he's not interested in me.</i>

487
00:29:08,125 --> 00:29:11,672
<i>There's nothing I can do...</i>

488
00:29:12,631 --> 00:29:15,585
<i>It hurts so much.</i>

489
00:29:15,585 --> 00:29:19,112
<i>It feels like my heart is being ripped apart...</i>

490
00:29:19,112 --> 00:29:23,017
Even as his assigned writer, I can't figure out
what's going on in In Uk's head.

491
00:29:23,017 --> 00:29:26,245
Imagine how frustrated Hyo Rim must feel.

492
00:29:28,900 --> 00:29:33,034
Why cry over one guy?
There are plenty of men out there.

493
00:29:33,034 --> 00:29:36,802
Sa Rang, it's not because she doesn't know.

494
00:29:36,802 --> 00:29:41,047
I mean, she could just choose someone else.

495
00:29:41,047 --> 00:29:44,497
Jin Seong's been all in on her since day one.

496
00:29:44,497 --> 00:29:47,780
Why choose the path that's only going to hurt?

497
00:29:47,780 --> 00:29:50,021
That's part of love too.

498
00:29:50,021 --> 00:29:53,497
You wouldn't understand.
You always rush into romances.

499
00:29:53,497 --> 00:29:56,795
Those relationships
come with plenty of tears too.

500
00:29:56,795 --> 00:30:00,123
That's not love. That's just dopamine.

501
00:30:14,236 --> 00:30:17,070
I'm going to look so puffy on camera.

502
00:30:17,977 --> 00:30:21,293
Are you okay to do the interview?

503
00:30:21,293 --> 00:30:23,601
Yeah. I'll try.

504
00:30:25,390 --> 00:30:30,903
After talking with In Uk today,
do you still feel the same way?

505
00:30:36,336 --> 00:30:39,299
I want to make a choice I won't regret.

506
00:30:41,057 --> 00:30:44,050
Even if my feelings are never returned...

507
00:30:52,011 --> 00:30:53,483
[Love Chain]

508
00:30:53,483 --> 00:30:56,014
[Final Choice Day,
Put on your final Love Chain]

509
00:31:01,332 --> 00:31:02,779
<i>Lastly...</i>

510
00:31:02,779 --> 00:31:08,302
<i>we'll hear contestant
Song Hyo Rim's final choice.</i>

511
00:31:26,589 --> 00:31:31,010
My final choice... is Seo In Uk.

512
00:31:43,935 --> 00:31:45,911
It's okay.

513
00:31:47,992 --> 00:31:49,655
I'm sorry.

514
00:32:24,778 --> 00:32:26,478
Sa Rang!

515
00:32:32,592 --> 00:32:34,292
Sa Rang!

516
00:32:35,179 --> 00:32:37,055
Where are you going?

517
00:32:37,055 --> 00:32:39,061
I did something I never should have done.

518
00:32:39,061 --> 00:32:40,677
What?

519
00:32:40,677 --> 00:32:43,546
- I'm really...
- Sa Rang!

520
00:32:45,070 --> 00:32:47,614
I'm the worst.

521
00:32:47,614 --> 00:32:50,315
This isn't your fault.

522
00:32:50,315 --> 00:32:54,015
I joined the show because of you
in the first place.

523
00:32:54,015 --> 00:32:56,194
I was arrogant.

524
00:32:57,328 --> 00:33:01,706
I deceived everyone because of that arrogance.

525
00:33:02,382 --> 00:33:07,015
I acted like only my feelings were
love... romance... destiny.

526
00:33:07,972 --> 00:33:09,924
Then what about my feelings?

527
00:33:11,032 --> 00:33:14,012
I understand why you feel guilty
toward the others.

528
00:33:14,012 --> 00:33:18,342
But what am I supposed to do
with the way I feel about you?

529
00:33:24,918 --> 00:33:26,923
I'm sorry...

530
00:33:29,035 --> 00:33:31,186
If you walk away first again...

531
00:33:31,186 --> 00:33:33,477
then this is where I end too.

532
00:34:08,126 --> 00:34:11,229
- Hey! Pass it here!
- Go for it!

533
00:34:11,963 --> 00:34:14,483
Sim Yu Geon!

534
00:34:18,565 --> 00:34:20,850
Seriously, he's...

535
00:34:20,850 --> 00:34:22,376
Just get out!

536
00:34:22,376 --> 00:34:25,099
He can barely even play,
yet he's trying to compete with

537
00:34:25,099 --> 00:34:26,961
those young guys and making such a fuss.

538
00:34:26,961 --> 00:34:28,424
Leave him.

539
00:34:28,424 --> 00:34:31,264
If he takes himself out of the competition,
that's good for us.

540
00:34:31,264 --> 00:34:34,803
- Ugh, seriously...
- Hey, I'm taking that fridge.

541
00:34:34,803 --> 00:34:37,036
No way, I can't give up the fridge.

542
00:34:37,036 --> 00:34:41,060
- The MVP prize is a refrigerator?
- It's right over there.

543
00:34:41,060 --> 00:34:45,616
Well... that changes things.

544
00:34:45,616 --> 00:34:47,678
So... are you pretty athletic?

545
00:34:47,678 --> 00:34:49,596
If I hadn't gone to art school,
I would've gone to sports college.

546
00:34:49,596 --> 00:34:52,509
Okay, check!

547
00:34:53,549 --> 00:34:55,478
- Hello!
- Hello!

548
00:34:55,478 --> 00:34:57,732
- Directors, come this way.
- Hello.

549
00:34:57,732 --> 00:34:58,819
- Director.
- Director!

550
00:34:58,819 --> 00:35:00,110
- You're here.
- Yeah.

551
00:35:00,110 --> 00:35:01,524
You're here.

552
00:35:01,524 --> 00:35:05,523
Wow... looks like Director Woo
isn't interested in winning any prizes, huh?

553
00:35:05,523 --> 00:35:08,965
I'll just cheer everyone on.
I'm not that competitive.

554
00:35:08,965 --> 00:35:12,660
Then you can be the Blue Team's cheer captain.

555
00:35:12,660 --> 00:35:14,011
Sounds good.

556
00:35:14,011 --> 00:35:16,439
- Blue!
- Oh!

557
00:35:16,439 --> 00:35:20,058
Well, here comes the Red Team's cheer captain.

558
00:35:51,182 --> 00:35:53,339
Oh, you all got here early.

559
00:35:53,339 --> 00:35:54,790
Wow!

560
00:35:54,790 --> 00:35:58,515
Feels like an airport departure.
Wow! A star really is a star!

561
00:35:58,515 --> 00:35:59,868
You look nice.

562
00:35:59,868 --> 00:36:02,044
By the way... what's all this?

563
00:36:02,044 --> 00:36:03,976
Camping's my hobby.

564
00:36:03,976 --> 00:36:06,507
So I brought a few things along.

565
00:36:06,507 --> 00:36:08,370
Of course you did...

566
00:36:09,647 --> 00:36:10,884
Oh, yeah.

567
00:36:10,884 --> 00:36:13,981
- Good work.
- Good work.

568
00:36:13,981 --> 00:36:15,237
Take it easy.

569
00:36:15,237 --> 00:36:17,453
[Sim Yu Geon, Actor, Plays Moo Gyeom]

570
00:36:25,358 --> 00:36:28,433
- Let me take it. It's heavy.
- Oh, thank you!

571
00:36:28,433 --> 00:36:30,252
Chae Yeon!

572
00:36:30,252 --> 00:36:32,737
It's heavy.

573
00:36:33,485 --> 00:36:35,465
Why are you suddenly talking to me?

574
00:36:40,739 --> 00:36:43,358
What's in here that makes it so heavy?

575
00:36:44,324 --> 00:36:48,414
Short ribs, flap meat, ribeye cap,
pork jowl, and pork belly.

576
00:36:48,414 --> 00:36:51,390
Ha Na prepared all of this.

577
00:36:51,390 --> 00:36:53,278
I didn't want to lose to that guy over there.

578
00:36:53,278 --> 00:36:55,884
[Cut! Let's take a short break]
- This is ramyeon. - Wow, it must be so good!

579
00:36:55,884 --> 00:36:58,897
Look at him. He brought
a whole truckload of stuff again.

580
00:36:58,897 --> 00:37:01,249
This is great!

581
00:37:01,249 --> 00:37:03,757
- What's this one?
- This is...

582
00:37:03,757 --> 00:37:05,574
Wow!

583
00:37:06,465 --> 00:37:08,767
Alright, listen up!

584
00:37:08,767 --> 00:37:11,588
The first game is Partner Dodgeball!

585
00:37:11,588 --> 00:37:14,678
If you're playing,
grab a partner and come on up!

586
00:37:14,678 --> 00:37:18,208
- I can't. My back really hurts.
- It's okay.

587
00:37:18,208 --> 00:37:20,125
Partner with me.

588
00:37:26,538 --> 00:37:28,604
I'll give it a shot!

589
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:33,631
AD, why don't we just have a beer instead?

590
00:37:34,703 --> 00:37:36,780
Director Ju, team up with me.

591
00:37:36,780 --> 00:37:38,531
Well...

592
00:37:40,844 --> 00:37:42,394
What is it?

593
00:37:45,183 --> 00:37:47,457
Oh, Director...

594
00:37:52,272 --> 00:37:53,922
This is...

595
00:37:55,556 --> 00:37:57,455
Wait, Director Ju!

596
00:37:57,455 --> 00:37:58,503
Ready...

597
00:37:58,503 --> 00:38:02,943
- Director Woo! You need a partner too!
- Yeah.

598
00:38:02,943 --> 00:38:04,643
Well...

599
00:38:20,217 --> 00:38:21,706
With me?

600
00:38:26,025 --> 00:38:29,492
Our target is Geum Seong Moo.

601
00:38:31,061 --> 00:38:32,544
I'm in.

602
00:38:33,603 --> 00:38:37,009
Dodge those balls like
you're dodging Japanese bullets.

603
00:38:37,009 --> 00:38:39,622
- Got it?
- Yes!

604
00:38:39,622 --> 00:38:42,028
[Baek Ho, DP]
Moo Gyeom, our independence... I mean,

605
00:38:42,028 --> 00:38:44,016
our refrigerator depends on you.

606
00:38:44,016 --> 00:38:46,179
- Okay?
- I got it.

607
00:38:46,179 --> 00:38:47,726
[Woo Soo Bin, Director]

608
00:38:47,726 --> 00:38:49,572
[Geum Seong Moo, Actor, Plays the Crow]

609
00:38:56,973 --> 00:38:58,499
So... are you any good at dodgeball?

610
00:38:58,499 --> 00:39:02,553
I'll protect Director Ju, so don't worry.

611
00:39:02,553 --> 00:39:06,166
- Good luck!
- Protect her? Worry about yourself first.

612
00:39:11,270 --> 00:39:12,844
Jeez...

613
00:39:28,802 --> 00:39:31,160
Two o'clock. Two o'clock.

614
00:39:31,160 --> 00:39:35,040
Don't hit Director Ju.
Go for Geum Seong Moo, no matter what.

615
00:39:35,655 --> 00:39:37,370
Don't worry.

616
00:39:42,526 --> 00:39:44,265
Seong Moo!

617
00:39:44,265 --> 00:39:46,032
DP, you're out!

618
00:39:46,032 --> 00:39:49,371
It's okay! Moo Gyeom,
you can just buy me a fridge instead.

619
00:40:00,951 --> 00:40:02,758
So close!

620
00:40:24,709 --> 00:40:26,585
What's with those two?

621
00:40:31,418 --> 00:40:34,302
Wait, there's still the Art team's pair too!

622
00:40:34,302 --> 00:40:36,409
- Hold on tight.
- Wait...

623
00:40:46,288 --> 00:40:47,713
You okay?

624
00:40:48,448 --> 00:40:52,137
Director Woo! You got separated
from your partner.

625
00:40:53,277 --> 00:40:55,078
You're out!

626
00:40:55,078 --> 00:40:57,055
Oh...

627
00:40:57,055 --> 00:40:58,873
Idiot.

628
00:40:58,873 --> 00:41:00,511
This matters.

629
00:41:00,511 --> 00:41:02,197
Can you get up?

630
00:41:17,243 --> 00:41:19,974
[Driver's License Written Test Questions]

631
00:41:22,575 --> 00:41:24,025
I'll be back.

632
00:41:24,025 --> 00:41:27,944
Oh, did you remember your pencil case?

633
00:41:27,944 --> 00:41:30,599
They take the test on a computer now.
Isn't that cool?

634
00:41:30,599 --> 00:41:32,889
Oh, really?

635
00:41:32,889 --> 00:41:34,524
Are you sure you'll be okay going by yourself?

636
00:41:34,524 --> 00:41:36,453
You can't even go around
the neighborhood alone.

637
00:41:36,453 --> 00:41:38,258
I'm not a little kid.

638
00:41:38,258 --> 00:41:40,295
Hold on.

639
00:41:40,295 --> 00:41:42,236
Well...

640
00:41:42,236 --> 00:41:45,366
I'll walk you to the bus stop over there.

641
00:41:45,366 --> 00:41:48,970
If we go at your pace, I'll miss the bus.

642
00:41:48,970 --> 00:41:50,889
Just stay and rest.

643
00:41:51,481 --> 00:41:53,327
I'm going.

644
00:42:26,358 --> 00:42:28,511
Ma'am!

645
00:42:28,511 --> 00:42:30,431
You're Soo Bin's mother, right?

646
00:42:30,431 --> 00:42:33,294
- Jin Su?
- Are you okay?

647
00:42:35,188 --> 00:42:38,499
- Do you need some help?
- No, I'm okay.

648
00:42:40,087 --> 00:42:42,050
Ma'am, where are you headed?

649
00:42:42,050 --> 00:42:43,245
Oh...

650
00:42:43,245 --> 00:42:47,292
I have to go take my driver's test...
I have to catch the bus.

651
00:42:47,292 --> 00:42:49,370
But then you'd have to go
all the way to Baemun-dong.

652
00:42:49,370 --> 00:42:50,817
Should I give you a ride?

653
00:42:50,817 --> 00:42:53,856
Really? Are you sure?

654
00:42:53,856 --> 00:42:56,142
I'm headed that way anyway. Hop in.

655
00:42:56,142 --> 00:42:58,878
- Yeah, thanks.
- Hop in.

656
00:43:04,665 --> 00:43:08,699
I'll get you there safely.

657
00:43:22,767 --> 00:43:26,057
Showing off again, huh? Jeez...

658
00:43:28,407 --> 00:43:30,860
What's in the post?

659
00:43:30,860 --> 00:43:34,847
[#HighValueDonorClubMembersDay #CEOAnSuHui]

660
00:43:34,847 --> 00:43:36,553
What is this?

661
00:43:36,553 --> 00:43:37,957
[What is this? Is this their party donation?]
[Throwing a party with donation money, huh?]

662
00:43:37,957 --> 00:43:39,677
Darn it... darn it!

663
00:43:39,677 --> 00:43:42,583
Which idiot posted this?

664
00:43:42,583 --> 00:43:43,751
Ugh, seriously...

665
00:43:43,751 --> 00:43:45,231
[Let's get Topline investigated
by the tax office]

666
00:43:45,231 --> 00:43:46,487
Ugh, seriously...

667
00:43:46,487 --> 00:43:48,602
Oh... ouch!

668
00:43:48,602 --> 00:43:50,920
Director Kim!

669
00:43:50,920 --> 00:43:53,008
Hey, Director Kim!

670
00:43:56,553 --> 00:43:58,661
Hey, you punk! Open the door...

671
00:43:58,661 --> 00:44:01,935
Hurry up and open the door. You're dead.

672
00:44:04,804 --> 00:44:07,395
Oh, darn it... Hey, you punk!

673
00:44:07,395 --> 00:44:09,161
How can you be sleeping at a time like this?

674
00:44:09,161 --> 00:44:12,855
- What... Did something happen?
- Get to the office.

675
00:44:12,855 --> 00:44:14,998
I'm gonna deal with the PR team.

676
00:44:14,998 --> 00:44:17,474
Oh boy, what happened this time?

677
00:44:17,474 --> 00:44:19,943
CEO An, this is exactly
why I can never leave your side.

678
00:44:19,943 --> 00:44:23,293
Director Kang! You'll be dead too!

679
00:44:23,293 --> 00:44:26,066
- Hurry up and go!
- Oh, yes...

680
00:44:26,066 --> 00:44:27,047
Hey, you punk!

681
00:44:27,047 --> 00:44:29,419
And why do you have your feet
on the steering wheel?

682
00:44:29,419 --> 00:44:32,024
Please fasten your seat belt, Ma'am.

683
00:44:39,051 --> 00:44:40,481
You all!

684
00:44:40,481 --> 00:44:44,578
Didn't I tell you this was a private party
and not to post it anywhere?

685
00:44:44,578 --> 00:44:46,715
Well, the thing is...

686
00:44:46,715 --> 00:44:48,460
Yes, you did.

687
00:44:48,460 --> 00:44:52,129
Then why was it posted? Who did it?

688
00:44:52,793 --> 00:44:56,058
Who's so desperate to bring me down?

689
00:44:56,058 --> 00:44:57,652
Was it you?

690
00:44:58,780 --> 00:45:00,837
Was it you?

691
00:45:00,837 --> 00:45:02,546
Come on, CEO An.

692
00:45:02,546 --> 00:45:05,436
Why go that far?
It was just a mistake by some clueless...

693
00:45:05,436 --> 00:45:06,556
Ouch!

694
00:45:06,556 --> 00:45:08,885
You idiot! You're the biggest problem!

695
00:45:08,885 --> 00:45:13,205
You can't even manage these morons.
What exactly do I pay you for?

696
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:19,654
- CEO An, the other employees are watching...
- So what? Did that hurt your pride?

697
00:45:19,654 --> 00:45:20,965
CEO An!

698
00:45:20,965 --> 00:45:24,802
Honestly, I can barely
keep up with your schedule as it is.

699
00:45:24,802 --> 00:45:28,844
I'm not even your personal assistant,
but I just drive you around and run errands.

700
00:45:28,844 --> 00:45:31,778
I honestly don't even know
what I'm doing at this company anymore!

701
00:45:31,778 --> 00:45:33,867
Oh my, Director Kang.

702
00:45:34,453 --> 00:45:37,166
You're the one who said
you'd do anything I asked.

703
00:45:37,166 --> 00:45:40,925
I was the one who took you in
when you had nowhere else to go!

704
00:45:40,925 --> 00:45:43,952
Got some money now,
and you forgot where you came from?

705
00:45:43,952 --> 00:45:47,213
Want to go back to scraping by?

706
00:45:53,773 --> 00:45:56,106
Director Kang, are you okay now?

707
00:45:56,827 --> 00:46:00,082
CEO An is really something...
What era are we living in?

708
00:46:00,082 --> 00:46:02,310
That's what I'm saying.

709
00:46:02,310 --> 00:46:03,552
Well...

710
00:46:03,552 --> 00:46:07,785
She treats you like some useless errand boy.

711
00:46:10,990 --> 00:46:14,535
By the way, are you really
going to keep working under CEO An?

712
00:46:14,535 --> 00:46:16,983
If I were you, I'd have started
my own company by now.

713
00:46:16,983 --> 00:46:19,958
Exactly. She needs to see
what it's like without you.

714
00:46:19,958 --> 00:46:21,461
That's right.

715
00:46:21,461 --> 00:46:23,421
Oh... you think so?

716
00:46:23,421 --> 00:46:24,807
You guys think so too?

717
00:46:24,807 --> 00:46:26,543
Of course.

718
00:46:26,543 --> 00:46:29,942
If you are, I'm following you no matter what.

719
00:47:14,801 --> 00:47:16,877
- It's hot...
- Be careful!

720
00:47:16,877 --> 00:47:18,614
Be careful.

721
00:47:29,517 --> 00:47:33,602
Here, say "ah," my hardworking director.

722
00:47:39,246 --> 00:47:40,825
Is that for me?

723
00:47:43,602 --> 00:47:47,066
You've been working hard, so... have a bite.

724
00:47:47,066 --> 00:47:48,817
My hands are full.

725
00:47:48,817 --> 00:47:50,786
Me. Give it to me.

726
00:47:52,922 --> 00:47:55,748
Yum! Delicious.

727
00:47:55,748 --> 00:47:58,051
- Thanks, Director Ju.
- Yeah.

728
00:47:58,984 --> 00:48:00,676
I'm not doing it.

729
00:48:03,247 --> 00:48:05,250
Then I'll take over.

730
00:48:05,250 --> 00:48:07,278
It's fine.

731
00:48:07,278 --> 00:48:08,199
Go eat.

732
00:48:08,199 --> 00:48:11,355
I came over here to get away from that table.

733
00:48:22,278 --> 00:48:25,396
That's enough. You've had way too much.

734
00:48:25,396 --> 00:48:28,825
I want to get drunk tonight.

735
00:48:28,825 --> 00:48:32,133
I want to see what you'll do if I get drunk.

736
00:48:33,302 --> 00:48:35,002
Give it back.

737
00:48:58,330 --> 00:49:00,287
Thank you.

738
00:49:12,321 --> 00:49:16,071
Hey, are you okay?
You were downing drinks earlier.

739
00:49:16,071 --> 00:49:17,936
Where's Ha Na?

740
00:49:18,587 --> 00:49:21,555
I don't know. Have you seen her?

741
00:49:21,555 --> 00:49:24,283
- Have you seen her?
- No.

742
00:49:30,588 --> 00:49:32,492
Hey, where are you going?

743
00:49:34,192 --> 00:49:36,792
Oh, Manager.

744
00:49:36,792 --> 00:49:39,865
Could you give this to Ha Na?

745
00:49:39,865 --> 00:49:41,945
- Okay.
- I think she's going to have a rough morning.

746
00:49:41,945 --> 00:49:46,851
Huh? But I thought...
she was with you, Yu Geon.

747
00:49:48,195 --> 00:49:50,678
She's not... inside?

748
00:49:50,678 --> 00:49:52,095
No.

749
00:49:55,903 --> 00:49:57,722
Oh, jeez...

750
00:49:59,471 --> 00:50:02,187
- Good work.
- Yeah.

751
00:50:07,868 --> 00:50:08,945
Who are you looking for?

752
00:50:08,945 --> 00:50:10,132
- Oh, no.
- Please come in.

753
00:50:10,132 --> 00:50:12,790
No, no. Enjoy your meal.

754
00:50:35,311 --> 00:50:37,213
What are you doing out here?

755
00:50:37,213 --> 00:50:39,376
Punishing you.

756
00:50:42,991 --> 00:50:44,827
Let's go.

757
00:50:44,827 --> 00:50:47,683
- Your manager's worried about you.
- What about you?

758
00:50:50,366 --> 00:50:53,058
You came because you were worried too, right?

759
00:50:54,597 --> 00:50:57,575
I'd be worried no matter who it was.

760
00:51:08,859 --> 00:51:11,667
It's just the two of us here.

761
00:51:12,525 --> 00:51:16,845
My mom isn't here. Neither are the staff...

762
00:51:18,053 --> 00:51:20,933
No one's watching us.

763
00:51:21,662 --> 00:51:23,797
So you can be honest.

764
00:51:23,797 --> 00:51:26,148
Just like you were back at the lodge.

765
00:51:50,565 --> 00:51:52,331
Forget it.

766
00:51:55,029 --> 00:51:57,409
- I'll take you back.
- Let go!

767
00:51:58,023 --> 00:52:00,187
You coward.

768
00:52:13,481 --> 00:52:18,408
Ha Na! Where have you been?
I've been looking all over for you.

769
00:52:18,408 --> 00:52:21,285
It snowed a lot earlier.
Why do you keep going out and about?

770
00:52:21,285 --> 00:52:24,036
Didn't I tell you to let me know?

771
00:52:24,944 --> 00:52:28,530
Wait, why is your face so red?

772
00:52:37,562 --> 00:52:39,772
<i>Meet me at the observatory.</i>

773
00:52:41,155 --> 00:52:43,156
Director Ju!

774
00:52:44,995 --> 00:52:47,395
What are you doing here, Seong Moo?

775
00:52:47,395 --> 00:52:48,972
Thinking about you?

776
00:52:48,972 --> 00:52:50,497
Come on...

777
00:52:50,497 --> 00:52:52,531
We're not on set.

778
00:52:52,531 --> 00:52:55,716
We don't have to be
actor and director here, do we?

779
00:52:56,376 --> 00:52:59,762
Do whatever you want. I'm leaving.

780
00:52:59,762 --> 00:53:01,614
Remember this place?

781
00:53:02,578 --> 00:53:06,912
Every time you tried to break up with me,
I'd bring you here to look at the stars.

782
00:53:06,912 --> 00:53:09,530
Oh, this is that place?

783
00:53:09,530 --> 00:53:14,986
You mean when you kept saying,
"I'll be your star" to stop me from leaving?

784
00:53:14,986 --> 00:53:17,971
Yeah. You really didn't know?

785
00:53:17,971 --> 00:53:19,915
Well...

786
00:53:19,915 --> 00:53:23,909
It was just a quiet forest back then.

787
00:53:25,193 --> 00:53:29,386
Wow, there aren't any stars at all.
There were so many back then.

788
00:53:31,364 --> 00:53:33,321
Yeah.

789
00:53:33,321 --> 00:53:35,676
They used to fill the whole sky.

790
00:53:38,309 --> 00:53:39,885
Yi Jae...

791
00:53:42,195 --> 00:53:45,128
The forest became a glamping site,

792
00:53:45,128 --> 00:53:48,841
and those countless stars have faded.

793
00:53:50,362 --> 00:53:54,900
But whether it was ten years ago or now,
I still feel the same way about you.

794
00:53:55,568 --> 00:53:58,944
- Seong Moo, I...
- I just...

795
00:53:58,944 --> 00:54:03,430
I still feel hurt whenever I think about you.

796
00:54:03,430 --> 00:54:05,547
You and I...

797
00:54:05,547 --> 00:54:08,871
We met when we were both struggling,

798
00:54:08,871 --> 00:54:10,949
with nothing to our names.

799
00:54:11,894 --> 00:54:13,459
Maybe...

800
00:54:13,459 --> 00:54:15,888
things are different now, right, Yi Jae?

801
00:54:15,888 --> 00:54:20,202
You already know the answer.
So why are you saying that?

802
00:54:27,720 --> 00:54:29,819
Are you still...

803
00:54:29,819 --> 00:54:31,975
hung up on your first love?

804
00:54:33,228 --> 00:54:35,317
Seong Moo, I...

805
00:54:36,004 --> 00:54:37,941
even now...

806
00:54:37,941 --> 00:54:41,990
I still like Woo Soo Bin.

807
00:54:50,901 --> 00:54:52,991
Why are you confessing to me here?

808
00:54:52,991 --> 00:54:54,857
Woo Soo Bin!

809
00:54:57,445 --> 00:55:00,130
As you can see, Yi Jae and I...

810
00:55:00,130 --> 00:55:02,604
aren't just some old first love.

811
00:55:02,604 --> 00:55:05,040
I let it slide because you didn't know.

812
00:55:05,040 --> 00:55:07,401
But now that you do,

813
00:55:07,401 --> 00:55:11,735
I'd appreciate you respecting our boundaries.

814
00:55:13,975 --> 00:55:16,351
- Let's go.
- Yeah.

815
00:55:49,273 --> 00:55:52,291
Ready... action!

816
00:55:53,770 --> 00:55:57,589
Stop!

817
00:56:02,859 --> 00:56:03,999
He's running that way!

818
00:56:03,999 --> 00:56:05,838
Stop!

819
00:56:26,879 --> 00:56:28,494
<i>Cut!</i>

820
00:56:30,064 --> 00:56:31,677
What's going on? Why is it so noisy?

821
00:56:31,677 --> 00:56:34,070
I'll check.

822
00:56:34,070 --> 00:56:37,428
Yes, sir. We're in the middle of
filming right now.

823
00:56:38,123 --> 00:56:41,121
What? What did you say?

824
00:56:41,944 --> 00:56:43,485
Director...

825
00:56:47,003 --> 00:56:49,909
Who said I was going in?
I'm here to meet Director Ian!

826
00:56:49,909 --> 00:56:52,454
But that's exactly what you
mean by going in right now.

827
00:56:52,454 --> 00:56:54,534
Is actress Oh Ha Na in there too?

828
00:56:55,412 --> 00:56:58,035
What are you doing right now?

829
00:56:58,806 --> 00:57:01,700
You can't just barge onto
a filming set like this!

830
00:57:01,700 --> 00:57:04,654
- There he is! Director Ian!
- Director Ian!

831
00:57:04,654 --> 00:57:07,192
Is it true you're CEO An Su Hui's secret son?

832
00:57:07,192 --> 00:57:10,483
Can you confirm the reports that
you were born from an extramarital affair?

833
00:57:10,483 --> 00:57:12,482
Are you admitting it's true?

834
00:57:17,558 --> 00:57:20,466
- What are you talking about?
- Ms. Oh Ha Na!

835
00:57:20,466 --> 00:57:23,264
- Ms. Oh Ha Na?
- It's Oh Ha Na!

836
00:57:27,406 --> 00:57:30,519
An audio recording of your mother,
An Su Hui, has just been released!

837
00:57:30,519 --> 00:57:36,253
Did you know that
you and Director Ian are half-siblings?

838
00:57:36,253 --> 00:57:38,276
Is Director Ian really
your biological half-brother?

839
00:57:38,276 --> 00:57:39,551
What?

840
00:57:39,551 --> 00:57:40,655
- Say a few words.
- Ms. Oh Ha Na!

841
00:57:40,655 --> 00:57:41,985
- Please answer me.
- Director Ian!

842
00:57:41,985 --> 00:57:43,851
- Could you say a few words?
- Please give us an answer.

843
00:57:43,851 --> 00:57:45,628
- How do you feel about their relationship?
- Ms. Oh Ha Na, could you look this way?

844
00:57:45,628 --> 00:57:48,000
- Casting favoritism allegations?
- Did you know and still take the role?

845
00:57:48,000 --> 00:57:50,937
- Ms. Oh Ha Na?
- Just a few words, please.

846
00:58:07,943 --> 00:58:09,698
[Thank you to Lee Joo Ahn
for the special appearance]

847
00:58:40,619 --> 00:58:42,814
<i>Let go of me!</i>

848
00:58:42,814 --> 00:58:44,177
<i>Before I lose it...</i>

849
00:58:44,177 --> 00:58:45,599
<i>I can do this, right?</i>

850
00:58:45,599 --> 00:58:47,606
<i>It's my first time doing this alone
without Director Woo...</i>

851
00:58:47,606 --> 00:58:49,699
<i>Yi Jae, it's okay. Calm down.</i>

852
00:58:49,699 --> 00:58:51,066
<i>You need to make a decision now.</i>

853
00:58:51,066 --> 00:58:52,102
<i>Otherwise...</i>

854
00:58:52,102 --> 00:58:54,326
<i>we'll have to halt filming immediately.</i>

855
00:58:54,326 --> 00:58:55,824
<i>Director Ju!</i>

856
00:58:55,824 --> 00:58:58,838
<i>I sincerely apologize as a director.</i>

857
00:58:58,838 --> 00:59:01,845
<i>Don't worry. I'll fix everything.</i>

858
00:59:01,845 --> 00:59:06,998
<i>If I step down,
can Director Ju Yi Jae continue the film?</i>
